WEBVTT

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:13.514
[theme music playing]

00:01:54.782 --> 00:01:56.158
Wuchang has fallen.

00:01:57.159 --> 00:01:59.077
As expected.

00:02:01.288 --> 00:02:03.498
Wise to withdraw our troops
when we did.

00:02:06.919 --> 00:02:08.420
What else?

00:02:10.798 --> 00:02:13.926
My apologies, Empress,
for taking so long to come and visit.

00:02:14.009 --> 00:02:16.929
I trust your accommodations
have been to your liking?

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:20.223
A cell is a cell,
no matter the decor.

00:02:20.307 --> 00:02:21.975
I could put you in a real cell, Empress,

00:02:22.059 --> 00:02:24.436
and prove that assumption so very wrong.

00:02:26.647 --> 00:02:29.066
I feel as if
I may have sprained my wrist.

00:02:30.693 --> 00:02:33.070
That's what your champion
took out of me.

00:02:34.112 --> 00:02:36.699
The blind man was more agile,
truth be told.

00:02:36.782 --> 00:02:39.492
Interesting choice for an assassin.

00:02:39.576 --> 00:02:43.246
I would have selected
someone with... eyes.

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:46.333
Even Fang Zhen seemed surprised by him.

00:02:46.416 --> 00:02:48.836
Someone had to allow him inside.

00:02:50.045 --> 00:02:52.798
I wish to see the Emperor.

00:02:52.881 --> 00:02:54.967
I wish to see Ling.

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:59.805
Ling is dancing her days away,

00:02:59.888 --> 00:03:03.350
and the Emperor is occupied
with complicated matters of state.

00:03:04.309 --> 00:03:06.394
I will send them your regards.

00:03:08.856 --> 00:03:11.066
In the meantime,

00:03:11.149 --> 00:03:14.277
we will continue to detain you
so as to protect you

00:03:14.361 --> 00:03:17.072
from murderers and assassins
who could strike at any moment.

00:03:32.504 --> 00:03:33.839
[horseman shouting indistinctly]

00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:36.424
Father!

00:03:36.508 --> 00:03:38.468
How fared you at Wuchang?

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:40.763
We saw victory, daughter.

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:46.684
The sight of you pleases me more.

00:03:49.021 --> 00:03:50.147
The Khan awaits you.

00:03:51.148 --> 00:03:52.983
He will wait a moment more.

00:03:54.026 --> 00:03:57.112
You have represented me well
in the Khan's court.

00:03:57.195 --> 00:03:59.447
Word is you are as formidable as ever.

00:04:00.448 --> 00:04:02.075
[Khutulun] On this...

00:04:02.159 --> 00:04:05.871
word is not as true
as it was even yesterday.

00:04:11.251 --> 00:04:13.378
I was bested, Father.

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:17.424
He must be a formidable wrestler.

00:04:18.508 --> 00:04:20.302
The Khan's warrior son, Byamba.

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:24.807
Do not be displeased, Father.

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:28.977
Did you surrender your honor?

00:04:30.437 --> 00:04:33.356
I surrendered mine to serve yours.

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:37.444
You wanted me closer
to the Khan's court, yes?

00:04:39.947 --> 00:04:41.239
I approve, daughter.

00:04:42.615 --> 00:04:44.367
You should pursue the warrior.

00:04:45.786 --> 00:04:47.745
[Kublai] House of Ögödei...

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.372
[Kublai laughing]

00:04:52.459 --> 00:04:54.752
Your Golden Horde took Wuchang.

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:58.924
As planned, Xiangyang
will not be resupplied.

00:04:59.007 --> 00:05:00.008
Mmm.

00:05:00.092 --> 00:05:02.135
Jingim's assault there was bloody.

00:05:02.219 --> 00:05:03.636
[Kaidu] We fared well, Great Khan.

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:06.932
But we had the men
and horses necessary.

00:05:07.891 --> 00:05:12.145
Their numbers seemed reduced,
but those who remained fought well.

00:05:13.146 --> 00:05:15.773
We marched the captured here
as slaves for your service.

00:05:15.858 --> 00:05:18.318
Your Khan is honored,
offers his welcome.

00:05:18.401 --> 00:05:21.571
Come. Let us raise
a cup in your honor.

00:05:28.703 --> 00:05:30.205
[door opening]

00:05:32.833 --> 00:05:35.252
War is on.
We need to escape now.

00:05:36.211 --> 00:05:39.089
I begged you to leave, Tulga,
to save us.

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:41.674
And you said you prayed to join me
in this life or the next.

00:05:41.758 --> 00:05:43.927
I give you that choice now!

00:05:44.011 --> 00:05:46.221
I am to leave with
the ladies of the court.

00:05:46.304 --> 00:05:47.389
They will know I am gone!

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:51.393
I cannot go with you.

00:05:53.061 --> 00:05:54.271
I do not want to!

00:05:55.605 --> 00:05:58.108
Then we shall live together
in the Blue Sky.

00:05:58.191 --> 00:05:59.484
[Kokachin gasps]

00:05:59.567 --> 00:06:01.611
-[door opening]
-[Za Bing] Get away from her!

00:06:01.694 --> 00:06:03.030
[Za Bing yelling]

00:06:05.657 --> 00:06:07.159
[Tulga] Kokachin!

00:06:07.242 --> 00:06:09.577
Za Bing, no!

00:06:10.913 --> 00:06:12.372
[Za Bing grunts]

00:06:12.455 --> 00:06:13.665
[Tulga gasping]

00:06:13.748 --> 00:06:15.542
The skulking is over.

00:06:16.459 --> 00:06:18.921
There is no love
with the Blue Princess.

00:06:19.004 --> 00:06:21.214
She harbors no feelings for you.

00:06:23.216 --> 00:06:24.217
Leave!

00:06:25.427 --> 00:06:26.761
Now!

00:06:30.015 --> 00:06:31.474
-Ahh!
-[Kokachin gasps]

00:06:34.894 --> 00:06:36.479
[Za Bing groaning]

00:06:36.563 --> 00:06:37.605
Za Bing!

00:06:37.689 --> 00:06:39.232
Nergüi?

00:06:39.316 --> 00:06:40.358
What have you done?

00:06:40.442 --> 00:06:42.360
[guards shouting]

00:06:43.361 --> 00:06:44.862
[sobbing]

00:07:25.737 --> 00:07:27.322
[sobbing] I'm sorry.

00:07:27.405 --> 00:07:28.781
[guards shouting]

00:07:28.865 --> 00:07:30.700
I'm sorry.

00:07:31.826 --> 00:07:32.827
I'm sorry.

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:44.881
[Ling Ling sniffling]

00:07:47.467 --> 00:07:48.551
[yelps]

00:07:51.804 --> 00:07:52.847
[whimpering]

00:07:55.517 --> 00:07:56.809
Barbarians.

00:07:57.935 --> 00:07:59.521
[healer] I must break the bones again

00:08:01.273 --> 00:08:02.815
to make them right.

00:08:13.994 --> 00:08:14.995
Do it.

00:08:18.206 --> 00:08:19.249
Heal her.

00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:20.500
[Ling Ling sniffling]

00:08:31.178 --> 00:08:33.013
Will you come out?

00:08:34.264 --> 00:08:38.393
Or just cling to the shadows
like a snake?

00:08:42.314 --> 00:08:44.107
[Ahmad] Snakes are not
attracted to shadows.

00:08:44.191 --> 00:08:45.817
A rat then.

00:09:06.796 --> 00:09:09.674
Have the Great Khan's troops
reached my home yet?

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:15.597
They would slow their march
as they approach.

00:09:16.848 --> 00:09:20.435
Let your people suffer
the horror of anticipation.

00:09:23.688 --> 00:09:28.568
Wuchang first?
As you tried before.

00:09:30.945 --> 00:09:33.698
Kaidu of the Golden Horde
has led the assault.

00:09:33.781 --> 00:09:37.034
And succeeded
where my brother Jingim failed.

00:09:39.036 --> 00:09:41.206
I have a place
in the royal family.

00:09:43.208 --> 00:09:47.712
Are you a whore's son?
That would explain your interest in me.

00:09:48.588 --> 00:09:52.175
My interest in you is self-interest.

00:09:52.259 --> 00:09:56.138
I have nothing to offer you now.

00:10:05.147 --> 00:10:06.814
[door opens]

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:09.192
[door closes]

00:10:18.285 --> 00:10:19.411
[Ahmad] You called for me?

00:10:19.494 --> 00:10:21.704
I thought you would have
left for the war camp.

00:10:21.788 --> 00:10:24.749
I want to know of the assassin's condition
before I depart.

00:10:24.832 --> 00:10:27.335
-Will she recover?
-Still uncertain.

00:10:27.877 --> 00:10:29.587
Has she offered anything of worth?

00:10:29.671 --> 00:10:34.801
No, Empress. Nothing of note.
Just mumbled worry for her daughter.

00:10:36.469 --> 00:10:40.056
Binding linen.
Her daughter resides with us.

00:10:43.893 --> 00:10:47.772
Or perhaps a resolution we seek
with something altogether different.

00:10:47.855 --> 00:10:49.399
You speak of amnesty?

00:10:49.482 --> 00:10:50.483
No, Empress.

00:10:51.526 --> 00:10:52.860
Her daughter survives.

00:10:52.944 --> 00:10:57.574
We now possess the same leverage
once held over her by Jia Sidao.

00:10:58.533 --> 00:11:00.368
When we need her,
she will do our bidding.

00:11:00.452 --> 00:11:01.744
Yes.

00:11:01.828 --> 00:11:05.207
Make sure she recovers.
Have news for me when I return.

00:11:06.458 --> 00:11:08.293
[Kublai] This is an accurate rendering,
Master Polo?

00:11:08.376 --> 00:11:11.421
[Marco] It is.
I saw the construction.

00:11:11.504 --> 00:11:13.089
The outer wall is a shell.

00:11:13.172 --> 00:11:15.842
There is no fortification.

00:11:15.925 --> 00:11:19.011
Crush the foot
and the body will fall.

00:11:20.137 --> 00:11:22.098
We take the city.

00:11:22.181 --> 00:11:24.934
Sidao will dirty his knees before me.

00:11:25.017 --> 00:11:27.687
[Jingim] The Chancellor is aware
he was infiltrated weeks ago.

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:30.940
Surely, he does everything in his power
to bolster his defenses,

00:11:31.023 --> 00:11:32.149
rectify his weaknesses.

00:11:32.234 --> 00:11:35.487
[Marco] Our scouts report they have been
repairing the wall night and day,

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.864
but it is still incomplete.

00:11:39.198 --> 00:11:41.200
We must strike immediately.

00:11:44.787 --> 00:11:49.041
Prince Jingim's words are
worthy of consideration.

00:11:49.125 --> 00:11:52.379
I can wait no longer.
Polo is right.

00:11:52.462 --> 00:11:54.922
If action is to be taken,
now is the time.

00:11:55.965 --> 00:11:57.634
Go as my envoy to Sidao.

00:11:57.717 --> 00:12:01.721
Extend an invitation for parley
on the eve of his defeat.

00:12:01.804 --> 00:12:05.308
If he bows to me,
he can avoid Mongol steel.

00:12:06.268 --> 00:12:10.187
Propose a peace, patience to him,
see what it gets you.

00:12:11.188 --> 00:12:14.401
Sidao will never be a subject
under the Khanate.

00:12:14.484 --> 00:12:16.694
And this offer will enrage him,

00:12:16.778 --> 00:12:21.240
but I've shown his council, army
and people that I'm a diplomat

00:12:21.324 --> 00:12:23.159
until the bitter end.

00:12:48.267 --> 00:12:52.730
You are the military emissary
to the Great Kublai Khan?

00:12:52.814 --> 00:12:57.569
I have that honor, Chancellor.
I am Vice Regent of the Secretariat.

00:12:57.652 --> 00:12:59.737
And a foreigner.

00:12:59.821 --> 00:13:02.031
You must be as wise
as you're ugly and odd.

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:07.537
Have you ever seen an image of
the Roman emperor Claudius?

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:09.497
Or the Hunnic ruler Attila?

00:13:09.581 --> 00:13:10.998
No.

00:13:11.082 --> 00:13:13.292
But you're now going to tell me
of the accomplishments

00:13:13.376 --> 00:13:15.462
of ugly men who were underestimated.

00:13:15.545 --> 00:13:20.425
I would not presume to educate you
on the wiles of political men,

00:13:20.508 --> 00:13:23.219
comely or otherwise, Chancellor.

00:13:23.302 --> 00:13:27.640
We had heard talk of Fang Zhen,
the Red Lotus,

00:13:27.724 --> 00:13:29.726
taking a role in your empire.

00:13:29.809 --> 00:13:34.063
There was an assassination attempt
in the fortress.

00:13:34.146 --> 00:13:36.858
Some tragedies were averted,
some were not.

00:13:36.941 --> 00:13:40.820
I was so deeply troubled
to hear of Kublai's own tragedy.

00:13:41.821 --> 00:13:44.574
Wives should not be taken
in such a fashion.

00:13:46.784 --> 00:13:49.746
It is a violation, yes.

00:13:51.914 --> 00:13:53.916
So...

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:58.212
as fletchers stockpile arrows
and your blacksmiths sharpen steel,

00:13:58.295 --> 00:14:01.132
you come with a bidding
from your adopted master?

00:14:01.215 --> 00:14:05.512
The Great Khan offers a parley
to avert further tragedy

00:14:05.595 --> 00:14:07.889
and discuss peaceful arbitration.

00:14:07.972 --> 00:14:10.016
Surely you mean my subjugation?

00:14:10.099 --> 00:14:13.645
It is not for me
to interpret my liege's intent.

00:14:13.728 --> 00:14:16.606
As his minister,
isn't that exactly what you do,

00:14:16.689 --> 00:14:18.691
if not sculpt his intent yourself?

00:14:18.775 --> 00:14:21.403
I offer counsel.

00:14:21.486 --> 00:14:23.738
The Khan's decisions are his own.

00:14:23.821 --> 00:14:26.282
And do you agree
with his decisions?

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:35.542
Kublai Khan is my leader, my guide.

00:14:36.543 --> 00:14:39.295
I serve God through serving him.

00:14:39.379 --> 00:14:43.716
The Khan is your divine conduit?

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:44.926
[Yusuf] No.

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:49.722
He is merely a man with a vision.

00:14:52.266 --> 00:14:57.146
A hard place, Vice Regent,
serving a will you do not endorse.

00:15:00.357 --> 00:15:03.986
Tell your master I will meet him
to hear his gracious offerings.

00:15:07.699 --> 00:15:09.492
Limp away now, messenger.

00:15:18.209 --> 00:15:20.753
[Khutulun] My father has
joined the war camp.

00:15:22.088 --> 00:15:25.007
Has Kaidu come for
the enemy's head or mine?

00:15:26.175 --> 00:15:29.804
He holds his oppositions
for Sidao, not us.

00:15:31.138 --> 00:15:33.099
What tactics do you devise?

00:15:34.601 --> 00:15:37.019
We ride as one <i>tumen</i>
along the bank.

00:15:37.103 --> 00:15:39.271
When the archer fires a whistler,
we disband.

00:15:39.355 --> 00:15:40.732
Wolf and crow.

00:15:40.815 --> 00:15:42.567
I take wolf, you take crow.

00:15:43.943 --> 00:15:45.487
Because you bested me?

00:15:47.071 --> 00:15:52.159
You think you will always ride wolf,
make me ride crow.

00:15:52.243 --> 00:15:57.665
I ride wolf because I have more lancers.
You have archers from the steppe.

00:16:01.878 --> 00:16:03.588
This is my father's tent.

00:16:03.671 --> 00:16:05.172
I don't care.

00:16:23.691 --> 00:16:26.152
Do you strategize
for the coming assault?

00:16:27.654 --> 00:16:29.947
Wolf rides crow?

00:16:33.284 --> 00:16:34.744
[sighs]

00:16:39.707 --> 00:16:42.794
We'll resume our war plans later.

00:16:49.258 --> 00:16:50.510
My Lady.

00:16:57.099 --> 00:16:59.769
Kaidu asked about you.

00:16:59.852 --> 00:17:03.397
How many horses in your herd,
how able a warrior.

00:17:05.357 --> 00:17:07.109
Now, I understand.

00:17:07.193 --> 00:17:10.237
He must check tooth and hoof
before settling terms.

00:17:11.238 --> 00:17:13.115
The union will please our father.

00:17:13.199 --> 00:17:16.243
And I will prove myself to Kaidu
in the shadow of the wall.

00:17:17.244 --> 00:17:19.997
-All will soon be settled.
-No doubt.

00:17:20.998 --> 00:17:22.750
Unless the war undoes us.

00:17:23.751 --> 00:17:27.755
Xiangyang will bow to our Khan.
We have the secret and the strategy.

00:17:27.839 --> 00:17:29.966
Why do you doubt?

00:17:30.049 --> 00:17:32.677
Our strategy turns
on a foreigner's secret.

00:17:33.678 --> 00:17:37.181
I do not trust the Latin
and neither does Ahmad.

00:17:37.264 --> 00:17:38.641
What does Ahmad know?

00:17:38.725 --> 00:17:41.060
Marco saved me
when he needn't have.

00:17:41.143 --> 00:17:43.187
He returned to Cambulac
when he could have fled.

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:46.983
Byamba, we do not know
what bargain was struck in your saving,

00:17:47.066 --> 00:17:48.776
nor what motivated his return.

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:51.362
Honor. Friendship.

00:17:52.071 --> 00:17:53.155
Perhaps.

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:56.701
Would you offer evidence
to support your doubts?

00:18:00.955 --> 00:18:02.331
Better.

00:18:03.332 --> 00:18:05.084
My confidence.

00:18:20.516 --> 00:18:21.517
[prisoner] Hey, blond man.

00:18:22.769 --> 00:18:23.978
Blond.

00:18:25.146 --> 00:18:26.480
Come here.

00:18:30.693 --> 00:18:32.403
Do I look blond to you?

00:18:34.363 --> 00:18:35.615
Blonder than me.

00:18:37.241 --> 00:18:39.076
Do you have any food, Blond?

00:18:48.961 --> 00:18:50.546
Thank you.

00:18:54.175 --> 00:18:56.385
Are you a fair-skinned
bastard son of the Khan?

00:18:56.468 --> 00:18:57.762
[laughing]

00:18:57.845 --> 00:19:00.389
No, I am his servant.

00:19:02.308 --> 00:19:05.770
I, too, will become his servant,
given the chance.

00:19:05.853 --> 00:19:06.979
You wish to be?

00:19:08.064 --> 00:19:09.398
I wish nothing more.

00:19:11.358 --> 00:19:13.152
What skill do you have?

00:19:14.445 --> 00:19:15.738
I'm a weaver.

00:19:15.822 --> 00:19:19.241
The Khan is fond of
artisans of every type.

00:19:19.325 --> 00:19:21.368
I'm sure you will fare well.

00:19:23.412 --> 00:19:27.499
What if the Mongols lose?
Would you still wish to serve?

00:19:29.877 --> 00:19:35.257
Men follow leaders.
Sidao is half the man the Khan is.

00:19:36.633 --> 00:19:39.804
Kublai Khan will win.
He will rule.

00:19:41.013 --> 00:19:44.684
Had you no knife to your throat,
would you feel the same?

00:19:47.394 --> 00:19:48.980
I see no threat.

00:19:50.397 --> 00:19:51.899
Merely fence.

00:19:51.983 --> 00:19:53.317
[Marco chuckles]

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:55.111
[prisoners clamoring]

00:19:55.194 --> 00:19:58.530
[prisoners]
Kublai! Kublai!

00:19:58.614 --> 00:20:01.701
They say the Khan welcomes anyone
if they pledge loyalty.

00:20:02.827 --> 00:20:04.328
Is it true, Blond?

00:20:05.705 --> 00:20:07.539
It is true.

00:20:11.043 --> 00:20:14.380
Will you come back, Blond?
Bring me more of that delicious meat?

00:20:20.136 --> 00:20:23.765
What is the state of power
within the fortress walls?

00:20:23.848 --> 00:20:27.018
I saw no sign of the Empress,
nor the Boy Emperor.

00:20:27.101 --> 00:20:31.522
We parleyed in the Song throne room
as though Jia Sidao were the emperor.

00:20:31.605 --> 00:20:34.316
Killed Red Lotus
and caged the boy.

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:36.277
Conspiracies abound.

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:38.237
He did imply one thing.

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:42.366
I believe he's under the impression
that his sister was successful.

00:20:42.449 --> 00:20:44.118
He thinks Lady Chabi is dead.

00:20:44.201 --> 00:20:46.495
This misinformation could be useful

00:20:46.578 --> 00:20:48.247
in distressing his state of mind
at the parley.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:52.084
The more unstable his mind,
the more unstable his choices.

00:20:57.464 --> 00:21:00.592
Kaidu, welcome to the war.

00:21:08.434 --> 00:21:10.477
I have already fought one battle.

00:21:11.687 --> 00:21:13.981
It seems as if
you have as well.

00:21:15.732 --> 00:21:16.984
[Kaidu sighs]

00:21:17.068 --> 00:21:20.571
Of all the warriors my daughter wrestled,
she settled on you.

00:21:22.156 --> 00:21:23.365
Why is that?

00:21:23.449 --> 00:21:27.829
She didn't settle. I won.
And I have personality.

00:21:28.913 --> 00:21:30.706
-[Kaidu chuckles]
-I swear.

00:21:32.708 --> 00:21:35.336
I have my thoughts in battle now.

00:21:35.419 --> 00:21:38.505
You can denounce me and call me pig
if you like, but wait for tomorrow.

00:21:38.589 --> 00:21:41.968
-And if you fall in battle?
-I am not that lucky.

00:21:43.052 --> 00:21:44.428
Yes.

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:48.224
I know of your prowess
on the field.

00:21:50.059 --> 00:21:53.020
Khutulun would never look your way
unless you were formidable.

00:21:54.021 --> 00:21:57.066
There's a reason
she leads one of my <i>tumens.</i>

00:21:58.442 --> 00:22:01.278
She knows strength and
noble character when she sees it.

00:22:03.197 --> 00:22:06.075
One wonders whether
the kingdom of Cambulac or its Khan

00:22:06.158 --> 00:22:07.743
have the same foresight.

00:22:10.913 --> 00:22:12.123
[sighs]

00:22:13.457 --> 00:22:15.084
Fare well tomorrow, Byamba.

00:22:19.755 --> 00:22:21.673
A fine horse.

00:22:23.134 --> 00:22:26.137
I am most pleased
it was not added to my herd.

00:22:41.777 --> 00:22:45.948
[Chabi] Our men suffer in furs and metal
under the South China sun.

00:22:46.991 --> 00:22:50.744
I had the armorer replace
all neck guards with hide.

00:22:50.827 --> 00:22:52.871
Jingim believes the Song Chancellor

00:22:52.955 --> 00:22:55.917
will never himself appear
on the field of battle.

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:58.752
Of that, Sidao is wise.

00:23:00.004 --> 00:23:04.675
My son would cut him from gut to mouth
in front of his own men.

00:23:06.677 --> 00:23:10.056
But hiding will not save his life.

00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:15.769
My Khan, my son,
they will have what is due them.

00:23:24.570 --> 00:23:27.489
You suspected me
when the young concubine died.

00:23:28.991 --> 00:23:31.785
Why not accuse me of the crime?

00:23:31.868 --> 00:23:33.662
You were too precious to the Khan.

00:23:35.122 --> 00:23:36.999
And I sense promise in you.

00:23:37.959 --> 00:23:39.626
What promise?

00:23:40.794 --> 00:23:42.421
I do not yet know.

00:23:45.674 --> 00:23:47.969
Am I precious to you?

00:23:58.312 --> 00:23:59.855
Your brother...

00:24:01.107 --> 00:24:03.900
made you into a whore for his ambition.

00:24:06.528 --> 00:24:07.738
Did that bother you?

00:24:07.821 --> 00:24:09.740
I made myself a whore.

00:24:09.823 --> 00:24:13.244
And I used him long
before he learned to use me.

00:24:13.869 --> 00:24:18.124
When he was a boy and I a little girl
living in the shadow of Xiangyang.

00:24:20.917 --> 00:24:25.089
I stared at the Walled City,
dreaming what life might be like there.

00:24:28.967 --> 00:24:31.262
What did you dream as a boy?

00:24:31.345 --> 00:24:34.473
I suffered dreamless sleep.

00:24:38.144 --> 00:24:40.896
Did you come to the Khan's service
by choice?

00:24:40.979 --> 00:24:42.606
No.

00:24:43.649 --> 00:24:45.151
By chance?

00:24:48.487 --> 00:24:49.905
As chattel?

00:24:54.743 --> 00:24:56.287
Born of Persia?

00:24:57.496 --> 00:24:59.748
My people were the Fanākatī.

00:25:00.874 --> 00:25:04.045
I'm from Upper Asia, not Persia.

00:25:05.129 --> 00:25:07.881
And brought to China
to serve your conqueror.

00:25:08.715 --> 00:25:11.635
I was too young then
to know him as a conqueror.

00:25:12.969 --> 00:25:14.888
He was my...

00:25:14.971 --> 00:25:17.891
my patron, my benefactor.

00:25:20.936 --> 00:25:25.691
He became as a father to me,
and the Empress, a mother.

00:25:25.774 --> 00:25:30.404
What happened to your real mother,
your true father?

00:25:31.780 --> 00:25:34.032
Was the Khan their benefactor, too?

00:25:44.501 --> 00:25:48.297
How do you serve the monster
who slew your brethren

00:25:48.380 --> 00:25:50.632
and call him father?

00:25:52.801 --> 00:25:57.306
You worship his whores,
concubine and queen.

00:25:59.266 --> 00:26:03.354
And you are left here as nursemaid
while war is waged.

00:26:07.358 --> 00:26:08.775
[Mei Lin sighs]

00:26:22.248 --> 00:26:24.750
You attempt to crawl under my skin?

00:26:30.547 --> 00:26:32.883
I could get under your skin,

00:26:32.966 --> 00:26:36.595
carve it free
and wear it as a cloak.

00:26:39.431 --> 00:26:40.557
Better...

00:26:41.350 --> 00:26:45.562
I could walk next door and
do the same thing to your daughter.

00:26:54.530 --> 00:26:55.697
What do you mean?

00:26:57.241 --> 00:26:59.493
Please, what are you--
What are you saying?

00:26:59.576 --> 00:27:02.538
War is waged on many fronts, Mei Lin.

00:27:02.621 --> 00:27:03.664
[Mei Lin] Please...

00:27:04.706 --> 00:27:07.959
What--
What are you saying?

00:27:42.578 --> 00:27:45.706
I once saw an ink portrait
of your grandfather.

00:27:46.373 --> 00:27:49.960
You are a more striking figure,
I must say.

00:27:50.043 --> 00:27:52.546
My mother
was more beautiful than his.

00:27:53.922 --> 00:27:56.007
She was a Christian, was she not?

00:27:56.091 --> 00:27:59.177
She was daughter
and mother to Khans.

00:27:59.261 --> 00:28:02.097
She could choose
whichever God suited her.

00:28:05.183 --> 00:28:10.314
You ask for parley as you stand
with an army outside my city walls.

00:28:11.773 --> 00:28:13.400
How am I to take this?

00:28:13.484 --> 00:28:17.195
On bended knee, if you're wise.

00:28:17.279 --> 00:28:19.656
I have a wall.

00:28:19.740 --> 00:28:21.908
I will obliterate your wall.

00:28:21.992 --> 00:28:24.953
I will take your fraudulent crown

00:28:25.036 --> 00:28:28.957
and I will spike your corpse
to the gates of my new palace.

00:28:29.875 --> 00:28:33.337
Or I will walk through the wall

00:28:33.420 --> 00:28:38.550
after it is freely opened,
accept your surrender

00:28:38.634 --> 00:28:42.679
and offer gracious terms for
the deposed Chancellor of Xiangyang

00:28:42.763 --> 00:28:44.723
and his rebel army.

00:28:44.806 --> 00:28:47.768
You have power yet
to save your people, Sidao.

00:28:51.355 --> 00:28:52.439
[clicks tongue]

00:28:52.523 --> 00:28:55.942
It's unfortunate
that it has come to this.

00:28:56.026 --> 00:29:00.322
So deep into war that we make attempts
on each other's lives

00:29:00.406 --> 00:29:02.783
and those most sacred to us.

00:29:02.866 --> 00:29:06.328
I've heard of
your favored wife's beauty.

00:29:06.412 --> 00:29:09.581
Such luminescence
should not be taken from us this way.

00:29:10.582 --> 00:29:13.126
So repugnant.

00:29:13.209 --> 00:29:16.422
Even your own Vice Regent
is against this war.

00:29:16.505 --> 00:29:19.132
This tactics.

00:29:28.642 --> 00:29:32.271
When an honest man says nothing,
you see his heart.

00:29:33.980 --> 00:29:36.608
I don't question his loyalty to you,

00:29:36.692 --> 00:29:40.612
but an absence of words speaks loudly.

00:29:43.324 --> 00:29:47.035
Perhaps he sees something we do not.

00:29:50.289 --> 00:29:53.750
I trust I'll find you
on the field, Jia Sidao.

00:30:02.968 --> 00:30:06.347
May I introduce my luminescent wife,
the Empress Chabi.

00:30:13.812 --> 00:30:17.816
I'm greatly pleased
to see you well, Empress.

00:30:17.899 --> 00:30:20.068
The Chancellor has declined my offer.

00:30:20.151 --> 00:30:22.237
There will be no peace this day.

00:30:22.821 --> 00:30:27.576
I will rip away his land as I would
a weak heart from a coward's chest.

00:30:27.659 --> 00:30:28.869
[soldiers shout in unison]

00:30:29.495 --> 00:30:32.998
Your people make better
slaves than soldiers, Sidao.

00:30:34.124 --> 00:30:37.252
Fear not, I will reform them!

00:30:37.336 --> 00:30:38.462
[Kublai laughing]

00:30:38.545 --> 00:30:40.130
[prisoners shouting]

00:30:42.048 --> 00:30:44.468
[shouting continues]

00:31:41.274 --> 00:31:43.444
I couldn't look away
when I first saw you.

00:31:45.236 --> 00:31:47.238
I tried.

00:31:47.322 --> 00:31:49.825
I tried to look away.

00:31:49.908 --> 00:31:54.621
I told myself, "She is nothing
but a whore, like the others.

00:31:55.914 --> 00:31:57.791
Like my sister.

00:31:58.917 --> 00:32:04.214
Meant to be used and discarded
to make room for another."

00:32:35.120 --> 00:32:36.955
I tried to find logic...

00:32:38.957 --> 00:32:45.255
only to realize what I feel for you
defies such reasoning.

00:34:05.043 --> 00:34:06.377
I loved you.

00:34:08.088 --> 00:34:09.380
You lied to me.

00:34:13.343 --> 00:34:14.595
[sobbing]

00:34:47.127 --> 00:34:48.795
[gasping]

00:34:53.759 --> 00:34:55.093
[sword clattering]

00:35:14.570 --> 00:35:15.781
[Marco] You see?

00:35:17.282 --> 00:35:18.324
[laughs] I don't.

00:35:18.408 --> 00:35:20.576
It's right here.
The horse.

00:35:21.870 --> 00:35:24.706
This is the horse,
this is the camel.

00:35:24.790 --> 00:35:27.751
That's the sheep and that's the goat.

00:35:27.834 --> 00:35:29.961
You see now?

00:35:32.255 --> 00:35:34.758
Roll. I'll show you.

00:35:39.805 --> 00:35:42.223
-[prisoner] Where do you live?
-That's the sheep...

00:35:43.433 --> 00:35:44.976
Inside the Imperial City.

00:35:46.436 --> 00:35:49.480
-An honor.
-It has become one.

00:35:51.107 --> 00:35:52.233
It wasn't always?

00:35:53.652 --> 00:35:55.904
I, like you, was once a prisoner.

00:35:56.905 --> 00:35:59.240
Within a slightly more gilded cage.

00:35:59.324 --> 00:36:00.784
[chuckles]

00:36:02.828 --> 00:36:04.329
I've never left home.

00:36:05.621 --> 00:36:06.832
Well...

00:36:08.166 --> 00:36:09.459
that's about to change.

00:36:10.543 --> 00:36:14.089
Yes. Wheeled away
in a celled wagon.

00:36:14.172 --> 00:36:16.591
Only until you arrive in Cambulac.

00:36:19.010 --> 00:36:21.387
Will I live in the Imperial City?

00:36:22.681 --> 00:36:24.307
Doubtful.

00:36:24.390 --> 00:36:26.977
But it will be a step up
from your current station.

00:36:31.272 --> 00:36:33.649
What will you miss most of all?

00:36:35.193 --> 00:36:36.903
[prisoner] Of my home?

00:36:41.992 --> 00:36:44.369
Can't think of anything.

00:36:46.329 --> 00:36:48.039
What do you miss
of your home, Blond?

00:36:53.211 --> 00:36:54.880
It's a horse.

00:36:59.801 --> 00:37:01.720
[Marco] What is it, friend?

00:37:01.803 --> 00:37:05.306
Jingim Khan has much to say
on the subject of Marco Polo.

00:37:05.390 --> 00:37:06.599
[Marco scoffs]

00:37:06.682 --> 00:37:10.520
He has high regard for
my political acumen, no doubt.

00:37:10.603 --> 00:37:14.024
He suspects you and your father
plot against the Khan.

00:37:16.777 --> 00:37:21.364
Ahmad has fueled his jealousy.
They believe you have seduced my father.

00:37:27.453 --> 00:37:29.289
Where do you stand, Byamba?

00:37:30.623 --> 00:37:35.253
You are not of this place, Marco.
Jingim is my brother.

00:37:35.336 --> 00:37:39.257
And what recourse
does your brother propose?

00:37:39.340 --> 00:37:43.053
In battle, arrows fly from all directions.

00:37:43.136 --> 00:37:45.889
Heed the advice
you should have taken long ago.

00:37:47.390 --> 00:37:53.188
As we advance south,
you ride west, towards your home.

00:37:57.733 --> 00:37:59.319
Where you belong.

00:38:04.866 --> 00:38:07.243
[prisoners shouting]

00:38:09.955 --> 00:38:11.497
[prisoner screaming]

00:38:28.223 --> 00:38:29.682
[screaming]

00:39:31.369 --> 00:39:33.371
[Hundred Eyes] They are to be
rendered into a weapon

00:39:33.454 --> 00:39:35.665
to rain fire upon Xiangyang.

00:39:35.748 --> 00:39:38.501
It is the Khan's strategy.

00:39:38.584 --> 00:39:40.921
He uses Sidao's citizens against him.

00:39:42.422 --> 00:39:44.840
[prisoner] I pledge my life
to the Great Khan!

00:39:44.925 --> 00:39:47.052
I pledge my life
to the Great Khan!

00:39:47.135 --> 00:39:49.888
-No.
-[prisoner] Blond! Blond!

00:39:49.971 --> 00:39:53.266
If you cannot bear what you see,
avert your eyes.

00:39:56.269 --> 00:39:58.104
They are our captives.

00:39:59.397 --> 00:40:01.066
This is sin!

00:40:01.149 --> 00:40:04.485
It is war.
Your Khan's war.

00:40:05.653 --> 00:40:08.698
Blond! Blond, help me!

00:40:08.781 --> 00:40:10.075
[prisoner grunting]

00:40:11.867 --> 00:40:15.621
I want to go home!
I want to go home!

00:40:17.123 --> 00:40:18.624
[prisoner screaming]

00:40:38.686 --> 00:40:41.314
[Kokachin]
Where are you going?

00:40:44.650 --> 00:40:47.153
What are you doing here?

00:40:51.449 --> 00:40:53.243
What happened?

00:40:54.785 --> 00:40:56.204
Are you hurt?

00:40:56.287 --> 00:40:58.081
[Kokachin] Za Bing was killed.

00:41:08.216 --> 00:41:09.842
[Kokachin sniffles]

00:41:15.098 --> 00:41:17.475
This is a dark time.

00:41:17.558 --> 00:41:21.229
There are eyes on me,
doubts directed.

00:41:22.355 --> 00:41:24.983
If anyone finds you here...

00:41:26.359 --> 00:41:28.194
You must go.

00:41:37.078 --> 00:41:39.039
I will return you to your <i>ger.</i>

00:41:42.792 --> 00:41:45.295
[Kokachin]
There will be eyes on me, as well.

00:41:49.924 --> 00:41:51.551
[shuddering]

00:41:54.679 --> 00:41:56.764
I am no royal.

00:42:04.314 --> 00:42:07.233
When the Khan's men
attacked the Bayaut...

00:42:08.484 --> 00:42:11.154
[sighs deeply]

00:42:11.237 --> 00:42:13.156
I was a peasant girl...

00:42:14.657 --> 00:42:16.534
serving in the palace.

00:42:18.994 --> 00:42:22.582
When they left,
I went with them to Cambulac...

00:42:23.916 --> 00:42:25.000
as Kokachin.

00:42:26.294 --> 00:42:28.671
You took her name?

00:42:28.754 --> 00:42:31.091
She took her life.

00:42:32.550 --> 00:42:34.969
I took her name.

00:42:37.430 --> 00:42:40.141
I must hold it forever.

00:42:44.895 --> 00:42:46.564
Her name is yours.

00:42:48.274 --> 00:42:49.650
Kokachin.

00:42:50.735 --> 00:42:52.737
I will protect that name.

00:42:53.738 --> 00:42:55.030
And you.

00:43:26.437 --> 00:43:27.563
[grunting]

00:43:32.277 --> 00:43:34.862
Does my husband require assistance?

00:43:34.945 --> 00:43:35.988
[Kublai grunts]

00:43:36.947 --> 00:43:40.951
Warm air constricts
the metal, leather...

00:43:41.035 --> 00:43:42.787
armor shrinks.

00:43:45.165 --> 00:43:46.666
No need.

00:43:46.749 --> 00:43:48.168
[breathing heavily]

00:43:49.710 --> 00:43:53.339
My soldiers with sturdy backs
will surround me.

00:43:53.423 --> 00:43:54.757
[sighs heavily]

00:43:55.675 --> 00:43:58.761
They will take stray arrows
for their Khan.

00:44:01.431 --> 00:44:04.434
My fierce Mongol warriors...

00:44:06.644 --> 00:44:09.063
so many will perish tomorrow.

00:44:11.691 --> 00:44:12.775
[Chabi] Yes.

00:44:14.026 --> 00:44:16.571
-You must rest, Kublai.
-Mmm.

00:44:18.406 --> 00:44:19.990
Genghis said...

00:44:20.991 --> 00:44:24.204
"There's no good in anything
until it's finished."

00:44:26.331 --> 00:44:28.666
Tomorrow...

00:44:28.749 --> 00:44:32.170
the wall that turned back
the Mongols for 80 years...

00:44:33.838 --> 00:44:36.006
will fall.

00:44:37.342 --> 00:44:39.719
Your men are prepared.

00:44:39.802 --> 00:44:43.138
And behind them,
Mongol women ready to fight if needed.

00:44:43.223 --> 00:44:44.432
[sighs]

00:44:45.808 --> 00:44:49.187
You do this and our house is whole,

00:44:50.187 --> 00:44:53.983
your legacy secured
for yourself and our son.

00:44:54.066 --> 00:44:55.109
Mmm.

00:44:55.192 --> 00:45:00.448
One Khanate, one Khan.
One China, one Emperor.

00:45:00.531 --> 00:45:02.074
[chuckles]

00:45:02.157 --> 00:45:03.158
Indeed.

00:45:04.159 --> 00:45:09.624
You will destroy the wall, my husband.
You will have the Chancellor's head.

00:45:09.707 --> 00:45:11.041
Hmm.

00:45:12.918 --> 00:45:16.547
I wish my astrologers
had such hopeful foretellings.

00:45:16.631 --> 00:45:21.010
But there is no good in anything
until it is finished.

00:45:22.428 --> 00:45:24.805
Let this war earn your peace.

00:45:24.889 --> 00:45:28.100
Let it be your final conquest,
my Khan Kublai.

00:45:30.227 --> 00:45:32.438
Let it be finished.

00:45:47.953 --> 00:45:49.497
[soldiers urging horses]

00:45:55.002 --> 00:45:57.004
[soldier commanding indistinctly]

00:45:57.087 --> 00:46:02.009
Let our horses be swift
and our arrows true.

00:46:02.092 --> 00:46:04.512
This day will be ours, Father.

00:46:04.595 --> 00:46:05.763
[Kublai] Hmm.

00:46:08.349 --> 00:46:12.645
Polo, I bid you watch
the battle with me from the crest.

00:46:13.854 --> 00:46:17.317
I ride with my Mongol brothers, Sire.

00:46:19.234 --> 00:46:20.403
So be it.

00:46:22.363 --> 00:46:24.532
I'll see you on the field.

00:46:24.615 --> 00:46:26.492
Do not lose your mount.

00:46:58.023 --> 00:47:01.276
-[soldiers yelling]
-[swords clanging]

00:47:04.279 --> 00:47:08.451
[Jingim] <i>We advanced, slaughtering every</i>
<i>rebel who crossed our path.</i>

00:47:10.703 --> 00:47:14.457
<i>We reached the wall</i>
<i>and pushed towards the weakness,</i>

00:47:14.540 --> 00:47:16.917
<i>the one the Latin described.</i>

00:47:17.001 --> 00:47:20.004
<i>We breached the wall with</i>
<i>little more than battering rams.</i>

00:47:21.088 --> 00:47:23.466
<i>But our men were wedged into a dead end.</i>

00:47:25.259 --> 00:47:26.927
<i>Death rained down upon us.</i>

00:47:28.513 --> 00:47:31.432
<i>Oil, fire, arrows...</i>

00:47:32.099 --> 00:47:33.434
<i>Men died.</i>

00:47:33.518 --> 00:47:35.520
<i>Mongols died...</i>

00:47:35.603 --> 00:47:40.107
<i>because Master Marco</i>
<i>pointed our army into a trap.</i>

00:47:41.484 --> 00:47:46.238
It was bait, Sire,
the weakness in the wall.

00:47:46.321 --> 00:47:48.282
Jia Sidao drew us into a trap.

00:47:50.576 --> 00:47:54.539
-I am sorry, Great Khan--
-Why do you feign contrition, Latin?

00:47:54.622 --> 00:47:58.167
Why are you not at the breast
of your master, Jia Sidao?

00:47:58.250 --> 00:47:59.293
Huh?

00:47:59.376 --> 00:48:02.087
You delivered us to the devil!
You betrayed us!

00:48:02.171 --> 00:48:04.507
You brought us to
our knees at the wall!

00:48:07.342 --> 00:48:09.136
Father...

00:48:09.219 --> 00:48:12.222
he has brought us nothing but ruin.

00:48:12.306 --> 00:48:13.974
You can see it.

00:48:14.058 --> 00:48:15.935
You can all see it!

00:48:16.018 --> 00:48:19.229
I devote myself to you, Great Khan.

00:48:19.313 --> 00:48:20.856
Enough of your twisted talk!

00:48:25.945 --> 00:48:28.113
You would protect him?

00:48:28.197 --> 00:48:30.950
He is not one of us, brother.

00:48:31.033 --> 00:48:32.993
He is the rot within our bones.

00:48:33.077 --> 00:48:35.705
He reported what he saw...

00:48:35.788 --> 00:48:37.665
as he was asked to do.

00:48:52.930 --> 00:48:53.973
Father...

00:48:56.851 --> 00:48:58.310
what shall we do?

